      "caption": "Submit by filling an io_uring_sqe and advancing the SQ tail; one io_uring_enter can submit many.",
      "narration": "To submit, fill an sqe and advance the SQ tail. A single io_uring_enter call can then submit a whole batch of requests.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Submitting",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 6,
          "w": 84,
